{
  "slug": "alphafi-2026-09",
  "kind": "other",
  "title": "AlphaLend ALPHA oracle misconfiguration and bad debt, announced 25 September 2026",
  "network": "mainnet",
  "summary": "Sui and AlphaFi announced on 25 September 2026 that a misconfigured ALPHA oracle on AlphaLend had left ALPHA-collateralised loans undercollateralised, that the bad debt was covered and that AlphaFi would wind down; no source names an id. On chain, AlphaLend's oracle has no ALPHA feed: since 9 December 2025 ALPHA has been mapped, by a change the admin 2-of-3 multisig sent, to the price slot of 0x3a5143bb::coin::COIN (Wormhole APT), which reads the Pyth and Pyth Lazer AVAX/USD feeds, so at 17:00 on 6 September 2026 ALPHA (about $0.72 on the market) was valued at $7.6335. On 6 September the multisig set the ALPHA market's safe collateral ratio from 0 to 94 at 16:41:09, 0xee5360c5 borrowed 1,012,240 USDC at 16:41:52 and 5,695,574 USDC and 23.8 xBTC in all by 17:12:01 against 3.26M ALPHA, the ratio was set back to 0 at 17:22:00, and on 20 September a 3-of-4 multisig repaid the loans of the four positions holding ALPHA collateral with alpha_lending::loan_bailout.",
